Wake-word model files in this folder (*.onnx, *.tflite)
=======================================================

These models are NOT covered by the MIT license at the repository root.

They were trained with openWakeWord (tools/wakeword_trainer.ipynb) on synthetic speech plus
background-audio datasets that carry mixed licenses, some of them non-commercial. The trained
models are therefore released under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0
International license (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/

Copyright (c) 2026 Nagendra Rao Jogi

You may use them for personal, non-commercial purposes. For commercial use, train your own model
on data you are licensed to use, or use a commercially licensed engine such as Porcupine.
